#upgrade-complete-modal-dialog.ui.modal
  .ui.card
    h2.card-header
      | Your workspace has been upgraded
    .card-body
      | What's new:

      ul
        li
          i.fa.fa-check
          | No hourly limits
        li
          i.fa.fa-check
          ' Advanced container management,
          a href="http://docs.nitrous.io/v1.0/docs/advanced-container-management-options" target="_blank" learn more
        li
          i.fa.fa-check
          ' Access to Nitrous Desktop app,
          a href=App.desktopDownloadUrl target="_blank" download now
        if App.upgradeCredited
          li
            i.fa.fa-check
            | Your $
            = App.upgradeCredited
            '
            | credit has been applied!

      p.small
        ' Your workspace will require some downtime in order to have its storage upgraded. Please contact
        a href="mailto:support@nitrous.io" support@nitrous.io
        |  to schedule the downtime.

    .card-footer
      .right
        button.ui.btn click='closeUpgradeModal target="view"'
          if App.containers.length
            | Go to my container
          else
            | Close
